# Solve for Disappointment: "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland permanent card from it. That player
# discards that card. Empower Jace 1." Bot2 holds Llanowar Elves (a creature), an Island and a Lightning Bolt. The Island
# is refused because the card must be nonland (CR 110.4a counts a land as a permanent card, so only "nonland" excludes
# it), the Bolt because an instant is no permanent card at all (CR 110.4a); the Elves are taken, Bot2 discards only them,
# and with no Jace token yet empower Jace makes one with one loyalty counter (CR 701.71a). The two Swamps pay for the
# spell and the Mox Jet.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Solve for Disappointment
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Llanowar Elves
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Solve for Disappointment.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Island)
! Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Solve for Disappointment
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace.Counters.Loyalty = 1
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
